
% Earned It

a: ii | vi |
In: ii | vi |
Vr: ii | vi |
link: ii | vi |
PCh: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
turnaround: vi | I | II |
turnaround_sub: vi | I | II | IV |
turnaround_full: vi | I | II | ii |
PostCh: $turnaround*2 $turnaround_sub $turnaround_full*7
turnaround_end: vi | I | V | II |
outro: $turnaround_end $turnaround
S: [F] $In $Vr $Vr $PCh $Ch $Vr $Vr $PCh $Ch $link $PostCh $outro
